s="container my-8"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 break-words text-sm text-muted-foreground sm:gap-2.5"><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><a class="transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/">Home</a></li><li role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="[&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><a class="transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/explore/">Explore</a></li><li role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="[&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><a class="transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/explore/places-to-go/">Places to go</a></li><li role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="[&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><a class="transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/explore/places-to-go/cities-towns/">Cities &amp; towns</a></li><li role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="[&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><a class="transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/explore/places-to-go/cities-towns/nelson-city/">Nelson City</a></li><li role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="[&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><a class="transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/explore/places-to-go/cities-towns/nelson-city/things-to-do-nelson-city/">Things to do in Nelson City</a></li></ol></nav><div class="ElementContent"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="container pt-6 md:pt-12 lg:pt-16 pb-6 md:pb-12 lg:pb-20"><div class="mx-auto flex flex-col prose lg:prose-lg xl:prose-xl max-w-prose text-center"><h1 class="!mb-8">The best things to do in Nelson City</h1><p>From city streets filled with art, good food and local finds to riverside trails, golden beaches and native bush, Nelson City packs plenty into a small space. Browse the markets, hit the bike trails, uncover local history or simply follow the Maitai River and see where the day takes you.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ElementalLeftyRighty"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="container flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center pt-12 lg:pt-20"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center aspect-[4/3]" style="width:100%;height:100%"><img alt="blurry placeholder" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full bg-light object-cover rounded" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><img alt="Nelson Museum Shop (1)" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover rounded z-[-10]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=85 16w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=85 32w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=85 48w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=85 64w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=85 96w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=85 128w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 256w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=85 384w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=85 750w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=85 828w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=85 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=85 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBy-NRDA%2FNelson-Museum-Shop-1__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85"/></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="prose max-w-none py-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-24 md:ps-12"><h2>Browse the central city shops and markets</h2><p>Nelson offers many shopping options, from fashion outlets to <a href="/explore/things-to-do/shopping-and-markets/jewellery">award-winning jewellery artisans</a> and boutique stores. Visit <a href="/retail-services/little-beehive-co-op">Little Beehive Co-op</a> for unique local <a href="/explore/things-to-do/shopping-and-markets/gifts-and-souvenirs">gifts and souvenirs</a>. On weekends, check out the <a href="/activities-day-trips/the-nelson-saturday-market">Saturday Market</a> in Montgomery Square, a 40-year tradition with musicians, performers, and diverse stalls. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ElementalLeftyRighty"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="container flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center aspect-[4/3]" style="width:100%;height:100%"><img alt="blurry placeholder" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full bg-light object-cover rounded" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><img alt="Woollaston Kiln near Riwaka credit Tim Cuff" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover rounded z-[-10]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-city-centre-artwalk%2FWoollaston_Kiln-near-Riwaka_credit-Tim-Cuff__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjQxIiwiLTAuMDUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=85 16w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-city-centre-artwalk%2FWoollaston_Kiln-near-Riwaka_credit-Tim-Cuff__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjQxIiwiLTAuMDUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=85 32w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-city-centre-artwalk%2FWoollaston_Kiln-near-Riwaka_credit-Tim-Cuff__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjQxIiwiLTAuMDUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=85 48w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-city-centre-artwalk%2FWoollaston_Kiln-near-Riwaka_credit-Tim-Cuff__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjQxIiwiLTAuMDUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=85 64w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-city-centre-artwalk%2FWoollaston_Kiln-near-Riwaka_credit-Tim-Cuff__FocusFillMa