walk%2FWoollaston_Kiln-near-Riwaka_credit-Tim-Cuff__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjQxIiwiLTAuMDUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-city-centre-artwalk%2FWoollaston_Kiln-near-Riwaka_credit-Tim-Cuff__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjQxIiwiLTAuMDUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=85 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-city-centre-artwalk%2FWoollaston_Kiln-near-Riwaka_credit-Tim-Cuff__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjQxIiwiLTAuMDUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-city-centre-artwalk%2FWoollaston_Kiln-near-Riwaka_credit-Tim-Cuff__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjQxIiwiLTAuMDUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85"/></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2 md:order-first"><div class="prose max-w-none py-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-24 md:pe-12"><h2>Enjoy art and artisan experiences</h2><p>Immerse yourself in Nelson&#x27;s creative scene. Visit the <a href="/activities-day-trips/the-suter-art-gallery">Suter Art Gallery</a> then take it outside on the <a href="/activities-day-trips/nelson-city-centre-artwalk">Nelson City Centre ArtWalk</a> or stroll along the Maitai River to see sculptures, murals, and mosaics. Don&#x27;t miss <a href="/activities-day-trips/jens-hansen-the-ringmaker">Jens Hansen</a>, the Nelson studio behind the original One Ring from The Lord of the Rings, and discover distinctive handcrafted jewellery made right here in the city.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ElementalLeftyRighty"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="container flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center aspect-[4/3]" style="width:100%;height:100%"><img alt="blurry placeholder" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full bg-light object-cover rounded" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><img alt="The Centre of New Zealand offers breathtaking views and is a must-visit spot in Nelson." loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover rounded z-[-10]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=85 16w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=85 32w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=85 48w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=85 64w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=85 96w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=85 128w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 256w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=85 384w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=85 750w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=85 828w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=85 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=85 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fthe-grove-scenic-reserve-walk%2FCentre-of-New-Zealand-Nelson-City-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyItMC4wOCIsIjAuMjUiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85"/></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="prose max-w-none py-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-24 md:ps-12"><h2>Go for a walk</h2><p>Starting from the city centre, a walk along the Maitai River leads to the base of the Botanical Reserve. A twenty-minute uphill trek under poplar and kauri trees brings you to the <a href="/scenic-attractions/centre-of-new-zealand">Centre of New Zealand</a> viewing platform, marked by a large white pin from the 1870s. Enjoy stunning views of the city, Tasman Bay, and the mountains. On your way down, try the Branford Park trail to the popular ‘Black Hole’ swimming spot, or continue to Walters Bluff for a longer scenic route. Alternatively, explore nearby gardens like <a href="/scenic-attractions/queens-gardens">Queens</a>, Miyazu, or Huangshi.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ElementalLeftyRighty"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="container flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center aspect-[4/3]" style="width:100%;height:100%"><img alt="blurry placeholder" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full bg-light object-cover rounded" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><img alt="Founders Heritage Park is a charming slice of Kiwi history, where heritage buildings, vintage trains, and local stories come to life." loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover rounded z-[-10]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=85 16w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=85 32w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=85 48w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=85 64w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=85 96w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=85 128w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 256w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=85 384w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=85 750w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=85 828w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=85 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=85 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ffounders-heritage-park%2FWindmill-at-Founders-Heritage-Park__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85"/></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2 md:order-first"><div class="prose max-w-none py-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-24 md:pe-12"><h2>Experience the history of Nelson City</h2><p>Stroll down <a href="/scenic-attractions/historic-south-street">South Street</a>, New Zealand’s oldest fully preserved street, and see the 1860s cottages built for early Nelson settlers. Explore <a href="/activities-day-trips/founders-heritage-park">Founders Heritage Park</a>, with its giant windmill gift shop, artisan buildings, bright red train ride, beautiful gardens, Bristol Freighter Plane cockpit, and replica fire brigade engine house. Don’t miss the <a href="/activities-day-trips/nelson-provincial-museum-pupuri-taonga-o-te-tai-ao">Nelson Provincial Museum</a> in the central city for galleries, exhibitions, and tours showcasing Nelson’s history.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ElementalLeftyRighty"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="container flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center aspect-[4/3]" style="width:100%;height:100%"><img alt="blurry placeholder" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full bg-light object-cover rounded" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><img alt="Walking to Water With Paddleboards at Tahunanui Beach" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover rounded z-[-10]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-to-Water-With-Paddleboards-at-Tahunanui-Beach__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=85 16w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-to-Water-With-Paddleboards-at-Tahunanui-Beach__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=85 32w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahu