ntasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-to-Water-With-Paddleboards-at-Tahunanui-Beach__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=85 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-to-Water-With-Paddleboards-at-Tahunanui-Beach__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-to-Water-With-Paddleboards-at-Tahunanui-Beach__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-to-Water-With-Paddleboards-at-Tahunanui-Beach__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=85 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-to-Water-With-Paddleboards-at-Tahunanui-Beach__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-to-Water-With-Paddleboards-at-Tahunanui-Beach__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85"/></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="prose max-w-none py-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-24 md:ps-12"><h2>Spend the afternoon at Tāhunanui Beach</h2><p><a href="/scenic-attractions/tahunanui-beach">Tāhunanui Beach</a> holds cherished memories and family traditions, from childhood sandcastles to sunset strolls. Just minutes from Nelson City, it’s a year-round local favourite for swimmers, dog walkers and families. Grab a coffee or an ice cream from the colourful container cafés, <a href="/activities-day-trips/paddle-nelson-paddleboard-hire">hire a SUP</a> and get out on the water, then settle in for a local brew and a bite at <a href="/eat-drink/sprig-fern-tavern-tahuna">Sprig + Fern</a>. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ElementalLeftyRighty"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="container flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center aspect-[4/3]" style="width:100%;height:100%"><img alt="blurry placeholder" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full bg-light object-cover rounded" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><img alt="Switchbacks at Coppermine Trail by Virginia Woolf" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover rounded z-[-10]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=85 16w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=85 32w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=85 48w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=85 64w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=85 96w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=85 128w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 256w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=85 384w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=85 750w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=85 828w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=85 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=85 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fcoppermine-trail%2FSwitchbacks-at-Coppermine-Trail-by-Virginia-Woolf__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85"/></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2 md:order-first"><div class="prose max-w-none py-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-24 md:pe-12"><h2>Go on a biking adventure</h2><p>Just minutes from the city centre, Nelson makes it easy to explore on two wheels. For a relaxed ride, follow the gentle <a href="/activities-day-trips/maitai-river-walkway">Maitai River</a> pathway past swimming holes and picnic spots. Ready to hit the trails? Family-friendly <a href="/activities-day-trips/koata-mtb-park">Koata Park</a> has options for a range of ages and abilities. Experienced riders can test their skills on Nelson’s iconic Grade 5 trails, or tackle the <a href="/explore/things-to-do/cycling-and-mountain-biking/great-rides/coppermine-trail-great-ride">Coppermine Trail</a>, one of the Ngā Haerenga Great Rides, for a half-day backcountry adventure.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ElementalLeftyRighty"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="container flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center aspect-[4/3]" style="width:100%;height:100%"><img alt="blurry placeholder" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full bg-light object-cover rounded" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><img alt="Nelson Boulder Bank aerial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover rounded z-[-10]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=85 16w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=85 32w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=85 48w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=85 64w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=85 96w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=85 128w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 256w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=85 384w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=85 750w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=85 828w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=85 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=85 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fnelson-boulder-bank%2FNelson-Boulder-Bank-aerial__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85"/></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="prose max-w-none py-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-24 md:ps-12"><h2>Visit the Boulder Bank</h2><p>For 10,000 years, debris from the Mackay Bluffs formed a rare 13km spit of boulders known as the <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="/scenic-attractions/nelson-boulder-bank" target="_blank">Boulder Bank Scenic Reserve</a>, sheltering Nelson&#x27;s harbour. An 8km walk offers a glimpse into its history, and climbing the lighthouse provides stunning 360-degree views. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ElementalLeftyRighty"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class="container flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center aspect-[4/3]" style="width:100%;height:100%"><img alt="blurry placeholder" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full bg-light object-cover rounded" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><img alt="Boat Shed Cafe food by Neat Places" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover rounded z-[-10]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fboat-shed-cafe%2FBoat-Shed-Cafe-food-by-Neat-Places__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=85 16w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fboat-shed-cafe%2FBoat-Shed-Cafe-food-by-Neat-Places__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=85 32w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fboat-shed-cafe%2FBoat-Shed-Cafe-food-by-Neat-Places__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMTAwMCwxMDAwXQ.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=85 48w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Fboat-shed-cafe%2FBoat-Shed-Cafe-food-by-Neat-Places__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwi