ll-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyItMC42NCIsIjAuMTYiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=85 384w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBrook-Sanctuary-Waterfall-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyItMC42NCIsIjAuMTYiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBrook-Sanctuary-Waterfall-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyItMC42NCIsIjAuMTYiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=85 750w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBrook-Sanctuary-Waterfall-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyItMC42NCIsIjAuMTYiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=85 828w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBrook-Sanctuary-Waterfall-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyItMC42NCIsIjAuMTYiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=85 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBrook-Sanctuary-Waterfall-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyItMC42NCIsIjAuMTYiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBrook-Sanctuary-Waterfall-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyItMC42NCIsIjAuMTYiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBrook-Sanctuary-Waterfall-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyItMC42NCIsIjAuMTYiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=85 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBrook-Sanctuary-Waterfall-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyItMC42NCIsIjAuMTYiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2FUploads%2FBrook-Sanctuary-Waterfall-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyItMC42NCIsIjAuMTYiLDEwMDAsMTAwMF0.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85"/></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="prose max-w-none py-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-24 md:ps-12"><h2>Discover a nature sanctuary</h2><p>Nestled in the valley behind Nelson City lies the <a href="/activities-day-trips/brook-waimarama-sanctuary">Brook Waimārama Sanctuary</a>, the South Island&#x27;s largest fenced haven for endangered flora and fauna. Immerse yourself in lush native bush and tranquil scenery, enjoying birdsong as you explore the sanctuary&#x27;s network of tracks. Discover diverse wildlife, waterfalls, and native plants in the mossy landscapes. Guided walks and winter glow-worm tours are also available.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ElementalPageGrid"><div class="relative"><div class="relative"><div class=""><div class="py-6 empty:hidden md:pt-12 container"></div><div class="relative w-full" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="flex -ml-4"><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 pl-4 relative max-h-[1400px] min-h-[500px] w-full 2xl:max-h-[75vh] 2xl:min-h-[800px]"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center bg-light md:aspect-video" style="width:100%;height:100%"><img alt="blurry placeholder" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full bg-light object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><img alt="Family cycling around Nelson Matai River Walkway by Oliver Weber" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover z-[-10]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_ne